study of a new case and review of the literature</article-title><source>J of Urol</source><year>1995</year><volume>154</volume><fpage>525</fpage><lpage>527</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7609125</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0022-5347(01)67094-0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Silverman</surname><given-names>S</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name><name><surname>Eversole</surname><given-names>LR</given-names></name><name><surname>Truelove</surname><given-names>EL</given-names></name></person-group><source>Essential of Oral Medicine</source><year>2001</year><publisher-name>Hamilton, London: BC Decker INC</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Engelhardt</surname><given-names>PF</given-names></name><name><surname>Hohlbrugger</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Riedl</surname><given-names>CR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Melanosis of the urinary bladder &#x02013; a case report with 10 years of follow up and review of literature</article-title><source>Aktuelle Urol</source><year>2006</year><volume>37</volume><fpage>222</fpage><lpage>224</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16733827</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1055/s-2005-919095</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>